2026-10-31 DESIGNER DECISION on the K2 0.9B R1 answer: R1 (k2-0p9b_high/R1.json) has 19,121 reasoning tokens and an answer field of 10,424 characters in which the model's own working-out precedes its end-of-thinking marker </ifm|think> (at character 8,516), followed by the final solution. The designer agreed to preserve the full output of the model unedited: the blind sheet shows the answer exactly as stored (working-out and tag included) and it is scored as it stands, with a note; nothing is cut or rewritten. The tag appears in no other 0.9B result so far (checked R2 to R5 and P1). If the same leak shows up in other results, the same rule applies: leave the stored output untouched.

